
%%{ c4: component }%%
graph TB

    Person(User, "Northstar User")

    subgraph Frontend {
        direction TB

        Component(Landing, "Landing Page", "Public introduction to Northstar")

        Component(Login, "Login Page", "User authentication")

        Component(Budget, "Budgeting Page", "Financial overview, goals, and plans")

        Component(Profile, "Profile Page", "User information, preferences, and linked banks")

        Component(Nav, "Navigation", "Routes users between pages")

        Component(API, "API Client", "Communicates with the backend")
    }

    Container(Backend, "Backend API", "Python / FastAPI")

    User -->|Visits| Landing

    Landing -->|Sign in| Login

    Login -->|Successful authentication| Budget

    Budget -->|Manage account| Profile

    Profile -->|Return to dashboard| Budget

    Nav -->|Routes to| Landing
    Nav -->|Routes to| Login
    Nav -->|Routes to| Budget
    Nav -->|Routes to| Profile

    Login -->|Authentication requests| API
    Budget -->|Financial data requests| API
    Profile -->|Profile requests| API

    API -->|HTTPS / REST| Backend
